# Play test of Saltmarsh Ferry (CIPlay saltmarsh_ferry, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the bank at the
# channel's end (1.4 m) by the ferry's stern, the Corps' office and its notice post, the reed cutter's camp (2.2 m) out in the marsh.
# Quest "Down the Marsh", 10 steps: ferry, notice, two hens, reed cutter's chest, the pump handle, the marsh
# goats, the hold, the rats, the locker, the safe.
island Saltmarsh Ferry
expect step 0
expect title Down the Marsh

# The bank at the channel's end: the ferry
walk 2 9 to 2 15 h=1.4
zone ferry
expect step 1

# The Corps' office: the captain's notice on its post, two of its hens
walk 1 15.5 to -6 15.5 to -9.4 14.6 h=2.2
read Captain's notice
expect step 2
catch Chicken 2
expect step 3

# The reed cutter's camp out in the marsh: the pump handle in his chest; the marsh goats
walk -10 13 to -20 2 to -30 -12 to -34 -17.4 h=3
reach Reed cutter's chest
open Reed cutter's chest
expect story pumphandle 1
expect step 5
catch Goat 2
expect step 6

# Back at the ferry: the bilge pump, then the rats boiling out of the hold
walk -30 -10 to -20 2 to -6 13 to 2 15 to 5 18 h=1.4
use bilgepump
expect message gushes
expect story pumphandle 0
zone hold
expect step 7
kill Rat
expect step 8

# The engineer's locker, clear of the mud now
walk 2 15 to -1 17 h=1.4
reach Engineer's locker
open Engineer's locker
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_MotorWheel 1
expect step 10

# The captain's safe on the bank by the ferry
walk 2 15 to 0.5 20 to 0.2 23 h=1.4
reach Captain's safe
open Captain's safe
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_SteeringWheel 1
expect done
